{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0314_1000_p", "source_sha256": "229fc4a0036c1a2e1f0769aa768bbe6a9ec6ba6242e094a23a2ce43367f73a7f", "ja": "（はぁ、はぁ……もうすぐ春香のソロライブの\n開演時間だ！　頼む、間に合ってくれ……）", "zh": "（呼、呼……春香的个人演唱会马上就要开场了！拜托，一定要赶上啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0314_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "5b86ae9e4241dfab79239810ce1cd8b6f36f84975a89260fd68b25696e488447", "ja": "うぅ……どうしよう。\nちょっと緊張してきちゃった……。", "zh": "呜……怎么办啊。\n我有点紧张起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0314_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5f6e722c8da6f0243da6b7007c6002f52bd352dbedfed7f2555103269bbafe04", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……あっ、春香！\n良かった、間に合った……。", "zh": "呼、呼……啊，春香！\n太好了，赶上了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0314_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "9b39379231ccbecf2c92c622bf9d664709e4af21a7b9a9a9e116317ef2109043", "ja": "えっ！？\n{$P$}さん……！？", "zh": "咦！？\n{$P$}先生……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0314_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "3feea083c35ea4639c12311dee76d633d7792c78f3cf4a9a952caaaaf45869a7", "ja": "ど、どうして……。たしか、今日はほかの\nお仕事があって、ライブには来られないって……。", "zh": "为、为什么……？我记得您今天还有其他工作，说是没法来参加演唱会的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0314_1005_p", "source_sha256": "6bb3a127ebed34a154c5502afe5307ef26369fae82aee866d79c118011c507f3", "ja": "その予定だったんだけど、今日は大きな会場での\nソロライブだし、どうしても顔を出したくてな。", "zh": "本来是那样的，不过今天可是大型场馆的个人演唱会，我实在想来露个面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0314_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "aa4b43727312279361c6563377a6ef9c0a724c1985eff2103d73e522b5c71714", "ja": "そうだったんですね……。ビックリしちゃいました。\n今日は来ないと思ってたので……。", "zh": "原来是这样啊……真是吓了我一跳。\n我还以为你今天不会来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0314_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "65110e754f195a69cb6cbf429bea72210f9a8e9b5833651ff820bbfcce3c2441", "ja": "って、あっ、もしかして、\nお仕事、途中で抜けてきちゃったとか？", "zh": "啊，对了，难道说，你是工作做到一半偷偷溜出来的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0314_1008_p", "source_sha256": "6acb5a959323755e48df6b2b6cba19a2d75f0e0217a88f02b608496820d9f4b8", "ja": "あはは、そんなことはしてないよ。いつもの\n100倍頑張って、終わらせてきただけだから！", "zh": "啊哈哈，才没有那回事呢。只是比平时多努力了100倍，把工作做完了而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0314_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "39e1584f42593af3e0722a13a226bda00e8d0cbc396fe83427eb7cbd6fba4685", "ja": "ふふっ、100倍って！　あ、いえ、そんなに無理\nしないでください。こんな、息まで切らして……。", "zh": "呵呵，竟然是100倍！啊，不，请不要这么勉强自己。都喘成这样了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0314_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "7ab90b0b7bdb3be185e4370fba11962c05a942c77b551939b9f9e61d23cf6ea4", "ja": "でも……。ごめんなさい。うれしいです。えへへ。\n私のために駆けつけてくれるなんて……。", "zh": "可是……对不起。我很开心。嘿嘿。\n你竟然为了我赶过来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0314_1011_p", "source_sha256": "5d3b897e14abe05779e23f2bccb0eb02d3a16fdce841b9233a60939124b7c59f", "ja": "喜んでもらえたなら良かったよ。最近はなかなか\n一緒にいられなくて、任せることも多かったしな。", "zh": "你能高兴就太好了。最近一直没怎么\n能陪在你身边，很多事也只能交给你自己来做呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0314_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "603f9ebd50599212dc5bf2a2033102aefed74c3ceb8fff7afeab1f675247606c", "ja": "そうですね。ひとりでお仕事をするのにも、\nだいぶ慣れてきたと思ってましたけど……。", "zh": "是啊。我本来以为自己已经渐渐习惯一个人工作了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0314_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "0796ab000a193f62f21f7e69deca23995d54a8a9ba4ffbc6397f41f32ad6d356", "ja": "私、今すっごくホッとしてます。やっぱり\n{$P$}さんがいると、違うなって。", "zh": "我现在真的松了好大一口气。果然有{$P$}先生在，感觉就是不一样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0314_1014_001har", "source_sha256": "475ac5b1812a21a6fa88f100203d64f70a5da98a4ad0c7cca93836007f768d56", "ja": "あっ、それじゃあ今日は、私のこと、\nいつもみたいに送り出してくれるんですね！", "zh": "啊，那今天你也会像平时一样为我送行吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0314_1015_p", "source_sha256": "74bcdd1a4b93e7506eeda313961b5c4fa47f67a8d25a020b8ecf1ead161faa8e", "ja": "ああ、もちろん！　そして、送り出したあとは\nここからしっかりと楽しませてもらうよ。", "zh": "啊，当然！送你出发之后，我也会好好享受这里的一切。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0314_1016_001har", "source_sha256": "00de56b0d5f97953c191218d074a72080c2191130cc83a96be743ae1581c7afd", "ja": "はいっ！　見ててください！\n今日のステージも、明日の私も……これからも！", "zh": "好的！请看着我！\n今天的舞台、明天的我……还有今后的每一天！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0314_1017_001har", "source_sha256": "f1647efde76911c90d79960e354bbb4b54662996280e683f28cf367faaecab5c", "ja": "ずっとずっとずーっと、\n一緒にいろんな景色を見ましょうね♪", "zh": "一直一直一直，\n我们一起去看各种各样的风景吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0314_1018_p", "source_sha256": "dc54179e9e55cb3f1a9d46284801a6954d034817e8225870f08d4ba08c153596", "ja": "ああ、約束だ。……っと、そろそろ時間だな。\nじゃあ、『行ってこい、春香！』", "zh": "啊，说定了。……哎呀，差不多到时间了。\n那么，『去吧，春香！』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0314_1019_001har", "source_sha256": "1188f12c3ff9a8619fc940f8259de62a66641b18db56cb366217116b2ce120e4", "ja": "任せてください！\n『行ってきます、{$P$}さん！』", "zh": "交给我吧！\n『我出发了，{$P$}先生！』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
